{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["The Mirror: Twin Cities - Overture","In order to escape the chaotic world, Na Sheng, an enthusiastic and cheerful Hmon girl, journeyed far and long seeking the home of her dreams, Yunhuang. But is Yunhuang really the fabled paradise of Taoyuan? With every step deeper into Yunhuang, scenes of strange and disturbing blood rain unfold; legendary figures with distinctive personalities compete on the stage, performing scenes of poignant and moving tales of myth."],"ja":["镜·双城 风起篇",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":50280,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-42794","ids":{"shikimori":42794,"mal":42794,"anilist":115834,"kodik":"serial-30206"},"kodikIds":["serial-28909","serial-30206"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-28909":"2020-09-01T04:40:11Z","serial-30206":"2020-11-25T11:21:18Z"},"title":"Зеркальный город Шуанчэн","originalTitle":"The Mirror: Twin Cities","alt":"ing: Shuang Cheng Feng Qi Pian / Jing Schuang Cheng The Mirror: Twin Cities - Overture 镜·双城 风起篇","description":"Во избежание смутные времена с энтузиазмом и жизнерадостная девочка Хмонг на Шэн На путешествует на дальние расстояния, чтобы найти дом-Yunhuang сон. Но на самом деле Yunhuang легендарный Таоюань чудес? С каждым шагом она берет глубже в Yunhuang, новых сцен нелепых и ужасающих бразды правления террора раскрывается.","year":2020,"type":"ONA","genres":["Экшен","Приключения","Фэнтези","Романтика"],"rating":6.63,"popularity":378,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[50280],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/42794/9e941ab97a4cbb7ea30f6f1fd3605867.jpeg","width":705,"height":990},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/06097c512c7c925ffd8ab7af63cf5bf6f5afb7e6.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1043","dubId":"1043","label":"Animy","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"openi